  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support for Promoting Inclusive Markets in Somalia. (NOT in Use Now)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Technical Support for Promoting Inclusive Markets in Somalia. (NOT in Use Now) is a component of Promoting Inclusive Markets (PIMS) in Somalia aimed at improving productivity, competitiveness, and long term jobs in six value chains. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;291,389. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Business policy and administration.</narrative>
  </description>
